# Ignore everything by default.
*

# Keep directories visible so allowed files can be discovered recursively.
!*/

# Keep this rule file.
!.gitignore

# Keep approved source and document/project file types.
!*.c
!*.h
!*.pdf
!*.md
!*.asm
!*.s
!*.docx
!*.excel
!*.cdkproj
!*.sh

# Keep every file under any Tool/lib directory.
!**/Tool/lib/**
